  "section_1_2_10": {
    "highlights": "Available for extraocular (eyewash) or intraocular use. Extraocular products must NOT be used intraocularly. Used to flush eyes or maintain anterior chamber shape during surgery.",
    "indications": "Extraocular: irrigate nasolacrimal duct, remove debris/stain. Intraocular: maintain anterior chamber shape, cool handpieces, lavage byproducts during surgery.",
